		<footer id="footer">        <div class="ft-top">            <div class="wrap">                <div class="ft-links">                    <ul>                    	                    			                    					                        <li><a href="/www/contents/834.do?mid=631" class="">저작권 정책</a></li>	                    					                        <li><a href="/www/contents/835.do?mid=630" class="">영상정보처리기기 운영·관리방침</a></li>	                    					                        <li><a href="/www/contents/833.do?mid=626" class="">조직도</a></li>	                    					                        <li><a href="/www/bbsPost/26/list.do?mid=602" class="">홈페이지 오류신고</a></li>	                    					                        <li><a href="/www/contents/879.do?mid=635" class="">챗봇 서울톡</a></li>	                    					                        <li><a href="/www/contents/881.do?mid=637" class="">누리집지도(Sitemap)</a></li>	                    		                    		                    	                    </ul>                </div>                <div class="ft-sns">                    <ul>                        <li><a href="https://blog.naver.com/hangangofficial" class="blog" target="_blank" title="새창열림">블로그</a></li>                        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/hangang.official" class="insta" target="_blank" title="새창열림">인스타그램</a></li>                        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@hangangofficial" class="youtube" target="_blank" title="새창열림">유튜브</a></li>                        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/hangang.official/" class="facebook" target="_blank" title="새창열림">페이스북</a></li>                    </ul>                </div>            </div>        </div>        <div class="ft-bottom">            <div class="wrap">                <div class="ft-left">                    <div class="ft-logo"><img src="/resources/zeroCMS/site/www/images/ft_logo.png" alt="서울특별시미래한강본부"></div>                    <div class="ft-txt">                        <address> 